```java
List<String> names = new ArrayList<>(Arrays.asList("Alice", "Bob", "Charlie"));

// forEach: default on Iterable
names.forEach(System.out::println);

// removeIf: default on Collection — replaces iterator-based removal
names.removeIf(s -> s.startsWith("B")); // removes "Bob"

// replaceAll: default on List — replaces all elements
names.replaceAll(String::toUpperCase);

// stream(): default on Collection
names.stream().filter(s -> s.length() > 4).forEach(System.out::println);
```

